      "ArticleTitle": "A rare case of Chiari type-1 malformation accompanied by symptomatic cerebrospinal fluid hypovolemia: comparison of congenital Chiari type-1 malformation and acquired Chiari malformation secondary to cerebrospinal fluid hypovolemia: case report.",
